## Code Example

```javascript
// simple circuit breaker
class CB {
  constructor() { this.failures = 0; this.state = 'CLOSED'; }
  allow() { return this.state !== 'OPEN'; }
  onFailure() { this.failures++; if (this.failures > 5) this.state = 'OPEN'; }
}
```

